WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:10,930
Slow down and open something?

2
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,820
Want to open this door

3
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,960
It seems I have to get through you first.

4
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:25,660
Red Man, lie down and don’t move.

5
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,860
This thing is poisonous. You can't bite it.

6
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,540
Even the beasts in the gutter dare to block the road

7
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:33,570
Let's go. Don't ask for help.

8
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:55,350
Underwater Jurchen Shaman with constant temperature all year round

9
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:56,830
This is the atmosphere of the entire mountain range

10
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:57,870
Everyone is gathered here
